Name: jmap_base_url
Type: STRING
Default-Value: NULL
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

The scheme and authority (e.g. "https://jmap.example.com") to prefix to
the URLs advertised in the JMAP Session object (apiUrl, downloadUrl,
uploadUrl and eventSourceUrl) and to the WebSocket capability URL, for
clients that cannot resolve relative URLs against the Session URL.  The
WebSocket URL uses "ws" or "wss" to match an "http" or "https" scheme.  Any
trailing slashes are ignored.  If not set, relative URLs are advertised.
